Reflection recorded: Eurostat supplies a very current and useful geography benchmark (19.1m EU tertiary students in 2024, discipline mix). UNESCO 2025 is authoritative but the extracted page lacks a global enrollment count. I still need a US/UK/India-sized entry-market benchmark and labor demand. More importantly, the question explicitly asks current official competitor prices/features/credentials, so the next search should gather those official pages. One final search can target university/provider partnership economics, grants, and cloud programs if needed.

